msgid "maxframe.learn.decomposition.TruncatedSVD"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._truncated_svd.TruncatedSVD:1 of
msgid "Dimensionality reduction using truncated SVD (aka LSA)."
msgstr "使用截断奇异值分解（又称 LSA）进行降维。"

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._truncated_svd.TruncatedSVD:3 of
msgid ""
"This transformer performs linear dimensionality reduction by means of "
"truncated singular value decomposition (SVD). Contrary to PCA, this "
"estimator does not center the data before computing the singular value "
"decomposition. This means it can work with scipy.sparse matrices "
"efficiently."
msgstr ""
"该转换器通过截断奇异值分解（SVD）进行线性降维。与 PCA 不同，该估计器在计算"
"奇异值分解之前不会对数据进行中心化处理。这意味着它可以高效地处理 scipy."
"sparse 稀疏矩阵。"

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._truncated_svd.TruncatedSVD:9 of
msgid ""
"In particular, truncated SVD works on term count/tf-idf matrices as "
"returned by the vectorizers in sklearn.feature_extraction.text. In that "
"context, it is known as latent semantic analysis (LSA)."
msgstr ""
"特别地，截断 SVD 适用于 sklearn.feature_extraction.text 中向量化器返回的词频"
"/tf-idf 矩阵。在该场景下，它被称为潜在语义分析（LSA）。"

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._truncated_svd.TruncatedSVD:13 of
msgid ""
"This estimator supports two algorithms: a fast randomized SVD solver, and"
" a \"naive\" algorithm that uses ARPACK as an eigensolver on (X * X.T) or"
" (X.T * X), whichever is more efficient."
msgstr ""
"该估计器支持两种算法：一种快速的随机 SVD 求解器，以及一种在 (X * X.T) 或 "
"(X.T * X)（取效率更高者）上使用 ARPACK 作为特征求解器的“朴素”算法。"

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._truncated_svd.TruncatedSVD:17 of
msgid "Read more in the :ref:`User Guide <LSA>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/reference/learn/generated/maxframe.learn.decomposition.TruncatedSVD.rst
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._truncated_svd.TruncatedSVD:19 of
msgid ""
"Desired dimensionality of output data. Must be strictly less than the "
"number of features. The default value is useful for visualisation. For "
"LSA, a value of 100 is recommended."
msgstr ""
"输出数据的期望维度。必须严格小于特征数。默认值适用于可视化。对于 LSA，推荐"
"取值为 100。"

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._truncated_svd.TruncatedSVD:24 of
msgid ""
"SVD solver to use. Either \"arpack\" for the ARPACK wrapper in SciPy "
"(scipy.sparse.linalg.svds), or \"randomized\" for the randomized "
"algorithm due to Halko (2009)."
msgstr ""
"使用的 SVD 求解器。\"arpack\" 对应 SciPy 中的 ARPACK 封装"
"（scipy.sparse.linalg.svds），\"randomized\" 对应 Halko（2009）提出的随机"
"算法。"

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._truncated_svd.TruncatedSVD:28 of
msgid ""
"Number of iterations for randomized SVD solver. Not used by ARPACK. The "
"default is larger than the default in `randomized_svd` to handle sparse "
"matrices that may have large slowly decaying spectrum."
msgstr ""
"随机 SVD 求解器的迭代次数。不被 ARPACK 使用。默认值大于 `randomized_svd` "
"中的默认值，以处理可能具有缓慢衰减的大谱的稀疏矩阵。"

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._truncated_svd.TruncatedSVD:32 of
msgid ""
"If int, random_state is the seed used by the random number generator; If "
"RandomState instance, random_state is the random number generator; If "
"None, the random number generator is the RandomState instance used by "
"`np.random`."
msgstr ""
"如果是 int，random_state 是随机数生成器使用的种子；如果是 RandomState 实例，"
"random_state 是随机数生成器；如果是 None，随机数生成器是 `np.random` 使用"
"的 RandomState 实例。"

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._truncated_svd.TruncatedSVD:37 of
msgid ""
"Tolerance for ARPACK. 0 means machine precision. Ignored by randomized "
"SVD solver."
msgstr "ARPACK 的容差。0 表示机器精度。被随机 SVD 求解器忽略。"

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._truncated_svd.TruncatedSVD of
msgid "type"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._truncated_svd.TruncatedSVD:45 of
msgid "array, shape (n_components, n_features)"
msgstr "array, 形状 (n_components, n_features)"

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._truncated_svd.TruncatedSVD:45 of
msgid "array, shape (n_components, n_features)"
msgstr "array, 形状 (n_components, n_features)"

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._truncated_svd.TruncatedSVD:49 of
msgid ""
"The variance of the training samples transformed by a projection to each "
"component."
msgstr "训练样本通过投影到每个分量后变换所得的方差。"

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._truncated_svd.TruncatedSVD:52
#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._truncated_svd.TruncatedSVD:58
#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._truncated_svd.TruncatedSVD:66 of
msgid "array, shape (n_components,)"
msgstr "array, 形状为 (n_components,)"

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._truncated_svd.TruncatedSVD:56 of
msgid "Percentage of variance explained by each of the selected components."
msgstr "每个选定分量解释的方差百分比。"

#: maxframe.learn.decomposition._truncated_svd.TruncatedSVD:62 of
msgid ""
"The singular values corresponding to each of the selected components. The"
" singular values are equal to the 2-norms of the ``n_components`` "
"variables in the lower-dimensional space."
msgstr ""
"对应于每个选定分量的奇异值。奇异值等于低维空间中 ``n_components`` 个变量的 "
"2-范数。"

